### 1. 获取签名示例（每次调用生成新的 timestamp/nonce/sign）
GET http://localhost:8080/demo/create-demo

### 2. 参数模式（query / form，三件套随表单提交，替换为 create-demo 生成的值）
POST http://localhost:8080/demo/form-body
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=nzxy&age=18&timestamp=1740000000000&nonce=xxxxxx&sign=xxxxxx

### 3. JSON body 模式（扁平，三件套放 header，替换为 create-demo 生成的值）
POST http://localhost:8080/demo/json-body
timestamp: 1740000000000
nonce: xxxxxx
sign: xxxxxx
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nzxy",
  "age": 18
}

### 4. JSON body 模式（嵌套展平，全部字段参与签名，替换为 create-demo 生成的值）
POST http://localhost:8080/demo/json-nested
timestamp: 1740000000000
nonce: xxxxxx
sign: xxxxxx
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {"name": "nzxy", "age": 18},
  "remark": "参与签名"
}

### 5. JSON body 模式（includeParams 白名单：仅 name/age 参与签名）
POST http://localhost:8080/demo/json-some-params
timestamp: 1740000000000
nonce: xxxxxx
sign: xxxxxx
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nzxy",
  "age": 18,
  "otherParam": "xxx 不参与签名，可任意修改"
}
